@startuml outbox

title Outbox Pattern Flow

participant "Use Case\nHandler" as Handler
participant "EShopContext\n(SaveChangesAsync)" as DB
participant "OutboxPublisher\nHostedService\n(每 5 秒輪詢)" as Publisher
participant "Kafka\n(outbox-events)" as Kafka
participant "OutboxConsumer\nHostedService" as Consumer
participant "IOutboxEventHandler" as EventHandler
participant "Email / ES" as Downstream

== 寫入階段（業務事務）==

note over Handler
  兩種觸發方式：
  1. 直接呼叫 outboxEventRepository.AddAsync()
  2. Aggregate 拋出 DomainEvent → EShopContext 自動轉換
end note

Handler -> DB : SaveChangesAsync()\n（含 OutboxEvent INSERT，Status=Pending）
note right
  同一 DB 事務確保業務資料與
  OutboxEvent 一起寫入或一起失敗
end note
DB --> Handler : OK

== 發送階段（OutboxPublisher 5 秒輪詢）==

Publisher -> DB : GetPendingAsync(batchSize=50)\nWHERE Status=Pending ORDER BY CreatedAt
DB --> Publisher : OutboxEvent[]

loop 每個 Pending 事件
  Publisher -> Kafka : ProduceAsync(topic=outbox-events,\n  key=EventId,\n  value=OutboxEventEnvelope { Id, EventType, Payload, Timestamp })
  alt 發送成功
    Publisher -> DB : event.MarkAsProcessed()
  else 發送失敗
    Publisher -> DB : event.IncrementRetry()
    note right: RetryCount >= 3 → MarkAsFailed()
  end
end

Publisher -> DB : SaveChangesAsync()

== 消費階段（OutboxConsumer 持續監聽）==

Kafka -> Consumer : Consume(topic=outbox-events)
Consumer -> Consumer : Deserialize OutboxEventEnvelope\n取得 EventType
Consumer -> EventHandler : 根據 EventType\n找到對應的 IOutboxEventHandler

note over EventHandler
  EventType → Handler 對應：
  ┌──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐
  │ product.upsert       │ ProductIndexOutboxEventHandler│
  │ product.delete       │ ProductIndexOutboxEventHandler│
  │ payment.paid         │ PaymentPaidEmailHandler       │
  │ payment.failed       │ PaymentFailedEmailHandler     │
  │ order.shipped        │ OrderShippedEmailHandler      │
  │ shipment.completed   │ ShipmentCompletedEmailHandler │
  │ auth.otp             │ OtpEmailHandler               │
  └──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘
end note

EventHandler -> Downstream : 執行對應業務邏輯\n（ES index / 寄信）
Downstream --> EventHandler : OK
Consumer -> Kafka : Commit offset

== DomainEvent 自動轉換（EShopContext）==

note over DB
  SaveChangesAsync() 內部呼叫 ConvertDomainEventsToOutboxEvents()

  DomainEvent → OutboxEvent：
  ┌──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐
  │ ProductCreatedEvent  │ product.upsert               │
  │ ProductUpdatedEvent  │ product.upsert               │
  │ ProductDeletedEvent  │ product.delete               │
  │ PaymentPaidEvent     │ payment.paid                 │
  │ PaymentFailedEvent   │ payment.failed               │
  │ ShipmentCompletedEvent│ shipment.completed          │
  └──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘
  注意：order.shipped 和 auth.otp 沒有對應 DomainEvent，
  由 Handler 直接呼叫 outboxEventRepository.AddAsync()
end note

@enduml
